<title>BELGIUM: Cobepa unit buys into Dutch Vegro.</title>
<headline>Cobepa unit buys into Dutch Vegro.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian holding company Cie Benelux Paribas (Cobepa) said on Friday its Dutch investment arm Paribas Deelnemingen bought a 25 percent stake in  Vegro Beheer, a holding company that controls Dutch heating and sanitary ware distributor  Groothandel Vegro.</p>
<p>Groothandel Vegro had 1995 sales of around 305 million guilders and net profit of 11 million guilders and is a leader in its market, Cobepa said.</p>
<p>Paribas Deelnemingen acquired its shares from  Sequoia Participatiemaatschappij CV, a fund managed by NeSBIC Groep BV (Fortis), Cobepa said.</p>
<p>-- Nick Antonovics, Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6817, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
